rt/validateBindings or exact scope must fail rather than weaken validation.\",\n176\t      \"Mutate one frozen hash, native script, env key, guard flag, tuple/schema, selection row, budget/quota, test or required control; fail exact scope even if the existing synthetic suite passes.\",\n177\t      \"Candidate/execution/GITHUB_SHA/HEAD mismatch, old source888 artifact relabelled as new candidate, dirty scoped source, archive omission or unsafe upload must remain rejected.\"\n178\t    ],\n179\t    \"offline_supporting_checks\": [\n180\t      \"Use owned disposable sandbox/fixtures only, no network/native PowerShell: exercise Git runtime config in child env with NOSYSTEM=1 and an owned empty global config, verify command-scope override via Git config query, no persisted core.longpaths and no env in a sibling child; no credential/config-store inspection.\",\n181\t      \"On proposed candidate, run unchanged tests/diagnostics/windows-p1-stages.test.ts with Node22/Vitest and preserve full scoped output and every test outcome. Do not use old 64/81 counts or parent narration as execution evidence.\",\n182\t      \"Use unchanged systemEnvironment with case-insensitive system keys plus the three checkout keys: only the five admitted system keys may survive. Review fixedEnvironment and guard extra-key rejection without launching a native child.\",\n183\t      \"Exercise existing import-without-side-effects, binding identity, source-provenance, B001 tuple, EOF/cleanup, caps/selection and sealed-file negative controls unchanged. Supporting env checks are a separate artifact, not a new allRequiredControlsPassed claim.\"\n184\t    ],\n185\t    \"native_after_separate_gate_only\": [\n186\t      \"Coordinator publishes exact accepted candidate C once to the already-locked diagnostic branch only; source888 rerun cannot execute the repaired workflow and is not a substitute.\",\n187\t      \"Capture new run final/jobs/artifacts/full log bytes without trimming, plus SHA-256 and resolved